4.6 Project Monitoring

Project progress can be monitored using a shared task checklist, regular team discussions, GitHub commits, and milestone reviews. Each completed phase should be reviewed before moving on to the next major activity.

4.7 Expected Result

The planning phase provides a schedule, task allocation, resource requirements, and risk-management approach for the systematic development of ComicCraft.
